{
  "title": "Jewelled herbal Polish pilchards Gratin",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Polish dish featuring pilchards, perfect for a sick day, with a crunchy herbal topping and a dairy-free friendly twist, served in individual ramekins.",
  "cuisine": "Polish",
  "diet": [
    "dairy-free",
